# GitHub linguist settings for the Rex repository.
# - NASM assembly is the compiler implementation language (dominant).
# - `linguist-language=Rex` activates once the "Rex" language is added to
#   github/linguist (tracking issue: PR to languages.yml). Until then the
#   attribute is ignored and .rex files are shown as REXX (default mapping).
*.asm linguist-language=Assembly
*.rex linguist-language=Rex
*.inc linguist-language=Assembly
